1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:22,280
Hello, I'm Park Jin-beom, who is working on visual creative in the name of TAGIREN.

2
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:27,120
Recently, I worked on a girl group aespa's We Flash album i-aespa character artwork.

3
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:30,640
Hi, I'm Yon Sanchez, a digital fashion creator and 3D artist.

4
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:34,520
My work focuses on creating realistic and visual-friendly clothes.

5
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:37,520
I worked with Jin-beom on the We Flash Universe project.

6
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:41,679
Two years ago, while preparing for an online lecture,

7
00:00:41,679 --> 00:00:48,439
I wanted to explain to the students how to make clothes and how to use existing asset clothes.

8
00:00:48,439 --> 00:00:50,920
At that time, I was looking for assets to use.

9
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:55,880
At that time, Yon had a lot of professionally and systematically produced clothes,

10
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:57,079
so based on Yon's clothes,

11
00:00:57,079 --> 00:01:00,039
I wanted to explain how to customize them to the students.

12
00:01:00,039 --> 00:01:02,719
That's when I got in touch with Yon.

13
00:01:02,719 --> 00:01:04,599
I think that's when we became friends.

14
00:01:04,599 --> 00:01:06,439
I looked at Jin-beom's Instagram and thought,

15
00:01:06,439 --> 00:01:08,439
Okay, this person knows what she's doing.

16
00:01:08,439 --> 00:01:09,560
I love her style.

17
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:10,799
I want to work with her.

18
00:01:10,799 --> 00:01:15,799
I-aespa's character artwork was uploaded to my SNS on SM Entertainment.

19
00:01:15,799 --> 00:01:19,719
I saw the previous character artwork and thankfully, he contacted me about the artwork.

20
00:01:23,719 --> 00:01:26,079
I think it was really good at the time.

21
00:01:26,079 --> 00:01:30,319
I always pursued a style that gave me a good opportunity to redesign the character of I-aespa

22
00:01:30,319 --> 00:01:35,359
and design new clothes, so I had a lot of fun working on it.

23
00:01:35,359 --> 00:01:37,679
I think it was a meaningful project.

24
00:01:37,679 --> 00:01:42,239
At that time, I was in touch with Yon, and I know Yon's excellent skills,

25
00:01:42,239 --> 00:01:46,359
so I asked him to work with me on the I-aespa costume production project.

26
00:01:46,359 --> 00:01:50,079
Jin-beom sent me a direct message asking me about this collaboration,

27
00:01:50,079 --> 00:01:51,480
and without thinking much about it, I said,

28
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,719
Let's go ahead with this.

29
00:01:52,719 --> 00:01:55,359
We connected very quickly. It was very natural.

30
00:01:56,079 --> 00:01:57,719
It can't be any better than this.

31
00:02:02,519 --> 00:02:04,120
Collaborating together has been very fluid.

32
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:09,360
We actively share connections, we give each other mutual feedback, and we help each other a lot.

33
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:11,680
The project had a clear line from the beginning.

34
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:12,879
The process was very fluid.

35
00:02:12,879 --> 00:02:15,960
I quickly made the basic structure and then added the details.

36
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:20,120
Yon and I had worked on a collaboration several times before,

37
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:25,199
and thanks to this project, we were able to quickly proceed with the project with smooth communication.

38
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:28,920
Thanks to the collaboration between Clou and Marvelous Designer,

39
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:31,640
I think we were able to work faster and more easily.

40
00:02:31,640 --> 00:02:33,840
Especially using Marvelous Designer,

41
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:37,680
we had more time to work on concepts and level of detail,

42
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:40,160
so we were able to create a high-quality artwork.

43
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:43,080
We were also able to work more effectively and efficiently

44
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:47,520
because we collaborated and communicated using Clou and Marvelous Designer.

45
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:51,760
And since the files are compatible, it's much easier to review them.

46
00:02:56,080 --> 00:03:02,520
I have been working with other K-pop artists since IESPA's Reflash Universe project.

47
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:07,200
I want to have a career in the game industry as well as fashion or entertainment,

48
00:03:07,200 --> 00:03:14,040
but my ultimate goal is to become a 3D artist in various industries, especially as a 3D character artist.

49
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:16,360
I loved working on the IESPA project.

50
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:18,760
It opened many doors for me to different projects,

51
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:23,400
with fashion brands, the automotive industry, and projects where you can always learn something new.

52
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:25,920
As a dream, I would like to create my own fashion brand.

53
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:30,320
But it's a long-term dream, so I'm not in a hurry to do it.

54
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:35,280
I need to keep learning, exploring, meeting people, and keeping myself informed about trends.

55
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:37,640
What is the most important part of your work?

56
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:40,000
Clou is an essential part of my work.

57
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,960
I would say it's my daily life.

58
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:45,520
Thanks to this, I can experiment digitally with different forms.

59
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:47,960
I'm looking forward to showing you my new projects.

60
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:51,080
Right now, I'm mainly dealing with Marvelous Designer,

61
00:03:51,080 --> 00:03:54,480
and I know that the compatibility between Clou and Marvelous Designer software

62
00:03:54,480 --> 00:03:56,040
is really good.

63
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:59,160
Also, in order to achieve my goal,

64
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:01,840
Marvelous Designer is a tool that should not be absent,

65
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:04,640
so I plan to use it consistently for my career.

66
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:07,840
What is your goal?

67
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:12,480
To be continued in the next episode.

